{"ref":"BDB, חֹ֫זֶק","hw":"חֹ֫זֶק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹ֫זֶק</span></big>  <strong>n.m. strength</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> cstr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:3\" href=\"/Exodus.13.3\">Ex 13:3</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזְקֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:13\" href=\"/Amos.6.13\">Am 6:13</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ יַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:3\" href=\"/Exodus.13.3\">Ex 13:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:14\" href=\"/Exodus.13.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:16\" href=\"/Exodus.13.16\">16</a> (all JE).<br><strong>2.</strong>  national strength <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:13\" href=\"/Amos.6.13\">Am 6:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:22\" href=\"/Haggai.2.22\">Hg 2:22</a>.","next":"BDB, חָזְקָה","prev":"BDB, חֶזְקָה"}